```Title: Active Directory Domain Trust Created or Modified (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1484.002 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 681ad72f-5173-4349-9d32-4695e938c122```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4706, 4716 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Planned trust creation or changes during mergers and migrations```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode IN (4706, 4716))
| table _time host EventCode SubjectUserName SubjectDomainName TargetUserName TargetDomainName MemberName
